'''Lots''' are housing areas of property that the player can own and build on. They can be accessed through the house icon on the bottom panel in the user interface. If you own multiple lots, it will pop up a small menu for you to choose which house type you want to go to.

You are able to place a multitude of [[Items|items]] inside and outside of your home. Some of these items, such as the [[Mega Dance Floor]] or [[Rocket Ship]], are interactive. Many of the items are just plain furniture, such as beds, dressers or bath tubs.

Both [[Membership|members]] and non-members start with one free apartment. Members additionally get one free [[Small Wilds House]], which is available by claiming the Members Only New House Package. There is one more upgrade, available in the [[Station Cash Marketplace|SC Marketplace]], called the [[Large Wilds House]].

